# Unreal Engine workspace scope

This is an Unreal Engine project. Agent work belongs in:

- `Source/` — C++ game code
- `Config/` — project ini
- `Plugins/` — plugin source (if present)
- `Content/` — assets, except generated partitions listed below
- `*.uproject`

Do not search, read, or edit generated output:

- `Binaries/`, `Intermediate/`, `Saved/`, `DerivedDataCache/`, `Build/`
- `.vs/`, `*.sln`, `*.vcxproj*`
- `Content/__ExternalActors__/`, `Content/__ExternalObjects__/`

If a build artifact is needed, regenerate it with UnrealBuildTool / the Editor rather than hand-editing generated files.
